# Commit credit

Every commit message must end with this trailer, including commits made by the agent:

```
Co-authored-by: Constantin Bogza <tinel.c@gmail.com>
```

The git author is already Constantin Bogza. The trailer names him on the message as well. Do not change git config. The hook `scripts/git/prepare-commit-msg` appends the line when it is installed as `.git/hooks/prepare-commit-msg`.
